          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Abaisiraeli banyu mubete muti, “Bantu ba Ruhanga,” mushube muti, “Abagonzibwa b'Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha rw'ekyo ndimushemashemya mutware mw'irungu, mugambire obugambo burungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo tuliba tuli okwo ndimugarulira emizabibuye. Oruhanga rwa Akori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Akori",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nikwo kugamba kuti: Amatangwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ndiruhindura mulyango gw'eshubi. Alimporora nk'okwo yampororaga ali muto, omu makiro ago yarugire Misiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Omukama nagamba ati, “Bir'ebyo olinyeta oti, ‘Mushaija wange,’ oliba otakinyeta oti, ‘Baali wange.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikulekeza amabara ga Baali, oliba otakigagamba rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bir'ebyo ndikora endagano n'enyamaishwa n'ebinyonyi n'ebyekurura. Ndichwa obuta n'embanda, mareho endashana, muture buhore emirembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikushelera obe wange eirai lyona. Orwo ndikushelera ndikukolera amazima n'obwesigwa, nkugiliire obuganyizi n'ekisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikusheleza obwesigwa; kandi olimanya Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
